Subject: [PATCH 1/6] =?UTF-8?q?fix(cuda):=20=E5=8E=BB=E6=8E=89=20DCU/dcc?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E4=B8=8D=E8=AE=A4=E7=9A=84=20--use=5Ffast=5Fmath=EF=BC=8C?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=94=B9=E4=B8=BA=E6=8C=89=E5=B9=B3=E5=8F=B0=E6=9D=A1=E4=BB=B6?=
